# LAR: on a visible code or data segment, LDT, TSS (286 or 386, available
# or busy), call gate or task gate, ZF=1 and the destination gets the
# descriptor's high dword masked to 00FFFF00h (FF00h for 16 bits).
# Otherwise ZF=0 and the destination stays.
# System types allowed: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 9, 0Bh, 0Ch (mask 1A3Eh).
const lar_types 16 6718
zext kind16 kind 16
lshr type_bits lar_types kind16
bit system_ok type_bits 0
or kind_ok segment system_ok
and allowed kind_ok visible
and valid found allowed
const rights_mask 32 16776960
and rights high rights_mask
$RESULT
flag ZF valid
preserve_flags remaining
retire
